      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_8e247854",
      "@type": "VisualMaterial",
      "instance_name": "baby",
      "label": "child wearing bear costume",
      "description": "A baby dressed in a brown and white bear costume with ears on the hood, sitting upright on a couch. The baby has wide, expressive eyes and appears to be looking directly at the camera in all three panels, with facial expressions changing slightly to convey innocence or surprise. The costume covers the baby's entire body, including the head, and has white accents on the chest and cuffs. The baby's hands are visible, sometimes holding small objects or resting on the lap.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
