      "instance_name": "toxicity_1",
      "label": "Harmful",
      "description": "The meme uses vulgar language ('shit on it') in a context that juxtaposes innocence (a baby) with a crude taboo action, which can be offensive or discomforting to some viewers. While not targeting specific groups, the use of taboo language and the incongruous humor can be considered potentially harmful due to its crude nature.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_146aced0"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
